Consequently, equipment was required to be taken out of service multiple times throughout the year to complete inspections that could have been performed during the initial shutdown. This resulted in avoidable operational disruptions and reduced overall maintenance efficiency. In addition, it was recognized that some equipment was not following legislative compliance for minimum inspection frequencies. ', N'To reduce unnecessary downtime of equipment and ensure compliance with legislation', N'10087', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/10865.jpeg', N'There were XXX maintenance plans that were associated with NDE legislative inspections which have not been previously audited for correctness or frequency.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/10865.jpeg', N'After the audit of NDE mobile and hoisting maintenance plans, 102 maintenance plans were changed to align the trigger dates to reduce downtime. It was also found that 74 amount of NDE mobile and hoisting maintenance plans were not compliant with legislation and maintenance plans were either edited or changed.

hoisting 58', NULL, N'Yes, downtime has been reduced and all hoisting and mobile now meet legislative inspection requirements.', N'Important to audit our current set up to ensure proper compliance and alignment', 0, NULL, N'Produtividade da Equipe: Eliminação de 100% do HH gasto na rota de lubrificação manual da Célula de Flotação. A equipe de campo foi liberada dessa tarefa repetitiva e realocada para atividades de inspeção crítica e análise, aumentando o valor agregado do HH de manutenção.
Performance do Ativo: Aumento da confiabilidade e disponibilidade da Célula de Flotação. A lubrificação automática e contínua com dosagem correta eliminou falhas por falta ou excesso de graxa, reduzindo o risco de desgaste prematuro dos mancais e paradas não programadas por falha de lubrificação.
Eficiência Operacional: A gestão da lubrificação passou a ser centralizada no CMA via sala de controle, com monitoramento em tempo real e rastreabilidade. Isso agilizou a tomada de decisão e permitiu atuação preditiva, saindo do modelo preventivo por tempo para um controle por condição.', '2026-04-30T00:00:00.000', '2026-06-26T09:26:12.000', N'81013253', NULL, NULL);
Performance do Ativo: Aumento da disponibilidade e vida útil do motor BP-2057-17. A proteção dos cabos de alimentação evita falha de isolação e queima. A proteção dos RTDs garante leitura correta de temperatura, mantendo a proteção térmica ativa e prevenindo dano por sobreaquecimento.
Eficiência Operacional: Eliminação de perda de produção por parada inesperada. Com a vedação e grau de proteção IP restabelecidos, o motor opera com maior confiabilidade em ambiente severo, sustentando a performance da planta sem interrupções.', '2026-03-03T00:00:00.000', '2026-06-26T10:31:05.000', N'300837', NULL, NULL);

From a procurement perspective, category spend was impossible to determine across time, plant location, vendors, and materials.', N'To create coordinate procurement strategy based on accurate categorization of goods', N'10310', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/10867.jpeg', N'Existing material category assignments within our material master database were inaccurate, wholistically.  

No single tool existed that could accurately provide material category spend across time, plant location, vendors, and materials.

No tool existed to support the creation of effective procurement strategies for goods to drive cost reduction.', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/10867.jpeg', N'Development of VNL material categories and manual assignment of ~14,000 unique Vale materials led to the creation of a Material Categorization Database. This Database was combined with Purchase Order history data, to create Material Categorization Report in PowerBi.

This tool allows for strategic procurement planning - spend can be tracked by plant, material categories and vendors, in addition to material order frequency, order quantities, etc.
', NULL, N'~25% of VNL''s warehoused materials were assigned new primary and secondary material categories that were reflective of the material itself. Although relatively low, the count represents ~95% of warehouse expenditure over the last two years.

The PowerBi report exists as a refreshable tool that can be made available to not only Procurement, but all Finance and Operations to better budget and understand spend analytics', N'A robust and comprehensive material categorization provides spend accuracy and granularity not previously achievable. ', 0, NULL, N'Less confusion and inaccurate data in the system', '2026-06-25T00:00:00.000', '2026-06-26T11:15:50.000', N'1009465', NULL, NULL);
