Work remains the same without the risks associated with the use and handling of generator in most cases. 
For areas where sampling duration exceeds battery life or battery use is not practical, the generator will remain available.
', NULL, N'Goal was achieved. Battery power will be the primary source of power for performing road dust sampling on paved roads.', N'When performing the vacuum quality control testing, the vacuum the old vacuum was identified as having reduced effectiveness due to wear. Vacuum quality control now has a baseline and can be validated periodically.', 0, NULL, N'Maior transparência na utilização dos recursos, identificação de períodos de ociosidade, melhoria na gestão das atividades e suporte à tomada de decisão baseada em dados.', '2026-06-10T00:00:00.000', '2026-06-30T16:15:22.000', N'200768', NULL, NULL);
