reduz o tempo de encerramento, evita erros e rasuras, além de auxiliar no fortalecimento da conformidade com os procedimentos internos e dos princípios de melhoria continua e 5s.  ', NULL, N'Sim, a melhoria implementada aumentou a eficiência e reduziu o tempo de encerramento da central de pts. ', N'Pequenas mehorias podem gerar resultados significativos na rotina operacional.', 0, NULL, N'Padronização do processo de homologação, redução da variabilidade nas solicitações, aumento da conformidade com os requisitos de compliance, melhoria da qualidade das informações, redução de retrabalhos e maior confiabilidade na tomada de decisão.', '2026-07-16T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-22T15:21:24.000', N'81054438', NULL, NULL);
Expected Savings: Outsourced laundry costs are expected to increase from approximately $80,000 to around $100,000 or more per year. After the first-year equipment investment, the on-site laundry could reduce recurring annual costs to approximately $64,063, representing a potential saving of about 36% per year, or approximately $35,937 annually, subject to validation of actual volumes, labour, utilities, maintenance, and licensing requirements.
It should be considered as a strategic option to stabilize long-term laundry costs and reduce dependency on external service performance.', NULL, N'Before implementation, Vale remains dependent on third-party services and costs, with limited control over the laundry process and the uniforms sent for cleaning. Costs are also expected to increase once linen is added to the laundry scope. After implementation, Vale will gain stronger process and quality control over its uniforms while reducing long-term costs.', N'Leveraging existing resources while focusing on a long-term solution can be an effective cost savings strategy.', 2, 3, N'Executamos a melhoria corretiva no componente para garantir a segurança e confiabilidade da operação.', '2026-07-22T00:00:00.000', '2026-07-22T15:23:23.000', N'81058075', NULL, NULL);

