The improper dilution and inconsistent flow were potentially causing poor Thickener performance', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/12021.jpeg', N'Installed new inline mixer, check valve, and added a flow meter for dilution. Also, we are now using PPLS as dilution for IR1 coag, coming off of a branch from the PPLS pump that was no longer in use. ', NULL, N'Yes, we are seeing improvements with Thickener operation and now have a constant dilution flow with the proper solution the circuit', N'time taken to use equipment we already have and proper solution for the circuit', 0, NULL, N'Com a equalização da massa processada entre os lados do britador mitigamos os efeitos nocivos do desgaste irregular dos côncavos e com isso cumprir a programação de desgaste dos revestimentos Côncavos. ', '2026-07-24T00:00:00.000', '2026-08-29T10:21:00.000', N'1008379', NULL, NULL);

