Maior segurança, confiabilidade e controle do processo', N'Segurança: melhoria das condições de trabalho, com redução da exposição dos profissionais a vazamentos e projeções de óleo hidráulico.', 0, NULL, N'Além da economia financeira e ambiental, foi obtida melhoria significativa na organização e padrão visual da caixa (5S), com eliminação do excesso de sacos e padronização do acondicionamento. Houve ganho na rastreabilidade das amostras através da etiqueta de controle com data e turnos, reduzindo o risco de perda e extravio, além de facilitar a rotina e garantir mais segurança e agilidade na busca das amostras.', '2026-09-02T00:00:00.000', '2026-09-04T13:23:03.000', N'81046197', NULL, NULL);
Constant water sprays would create the same issues. Need to automatically control the water sprays when a scoop is entering and exiting a draw point.', N'Automate water spray control for RCT Operations', N'10260', N'01 - Imagens/01 - Antes/12170.jpeg', N'•	The mine is dry and dusty. Mucking with a scoop generates heavy dust; water spray is used to wet the area and suppress it.
•	Placing a controlled spray system near an active draw point traditionally meant running dedicated power (and/or fiber) thousands of feet through the drift — high material and labour cost.
•	Continuous spray coated autonomous scoop cameras with mist, reducing visibility for the surface operator and interrupting mucking.
•	Autonomous mucking depends on the LTE signal. Microhard NMDs already monitor signal across the mine, but there was no unit close to the active mucking location with its metrics easily accessible on the process HMI.
•	Conventional PLC setups each carried a unique IP and a local program, so a field swap required an automation technician with a laptop.
', N'01 - Imagens/02 - Depois/12170.jpeg', N'Power and connectivity — no dedicated utility runs
•	Power is taken from existing infrastructure via a Geo-Beacon 48 VDC tap on the LTE cable (power only).
•	Each unit is built for either source: a 120 V supply or a 48 VDC-to-24 VDC converter. All controls run at 24 V, and a simple wiring change by the electrician during install selects the source. 
•	Communication is over the LTE radiating cable: the Microhard modem connects to the LTE/radiating cable, and the PLC connects to the modem by Ethernet.
•	On one 450 m LTE run, a box was powered and connected at roughly the 425 m mark off a Geo-Beacon tap — running reliably with zero dedicated power or fiber pulled to that location. This is the core saving: thousands of feet of cable, plus the labour to hang it, eliminated.
RCT operations have confirmed effective control of dust and no detriment to camera image clarity.
', NULL, N'Yes. The issue of visibility during remote scoop operations was greatly improved.', N'*See Action plan implementation* It works!', 0, NULL, N'Foi superado pois gastamos pouco e reduzimos o tempo ', '2026-08-31T00:00:00.000', '2026-09-04T14:19:16.000', N'81025074', NULL, NULL);
